Read tags with a local module instead of the playing stream's context.

ReadTag() reopened ctx.file and stored the new module in ctx.module without
destroying it. Each tag read leaked a whole decoded module and, on an
instance that is playing, replaced the stream's module and file under it.

Upstream: generic bug, suitable for xbmc/audiodecoder.openmpt.

--- a/src/OpenMptCodec.cpp
+++ b/src/OpenMptCodec.cpp
